notes:
•  NEW: SOFTBUTTONS section in the left panel (above PTZ) - coloured one-click buttons for the active tile's camera, like the softbuttons down the left of a MOBOTIX camera's own Live page:
     - starting set: Identify (camera LEDs on for 10 s), Alarm Sound (asks first), Snapshot, Instant Replay, Home View, Camera Web Page;
     - the camera's OWN softbuttons (from its Admin Menu > Softbuttons) appear too, marked •, when they run a camera command or change a setting;
     - ✎ Edit... adds and changes buttons: name, colour, all cameras or one camera, and what it does - a camera command (the list shows what the camera can do), change a camera setting (section=... name=value, like the camera's dialog), any address on the camera, any web address (e.g. a door relay: http://user:password@10.0.0.5/relay?on=1), or an MxScout action; optional "Are you sure?"; Test button;
     - the result shows under the buttons (✔ / ✖ with the camera's answer). Right-click a button to edit it.
     Click the SOFTBUTTONS bar to fold the section away.
